units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
timestep 0.001

lattice fcc 4.05
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 26.9815
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes dist gaussian

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt1.potential Al

thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal

fix npt all npt temp 300 300 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
run 10
unfix npt